          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How it feels",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Soft, airy, and breathable with the familiar comfort of crisp organic cotton. The Breezeline weave allows air to flow freely, helping release heat instead of trapping it for a cooler, more comfortable night's sleep. Every wash makes them even softer.</p><p></p>",
