          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Organic Cotton</strong> — 100% certified organic cotton in a pure cotton weave. It lets your skin breathe, balances moisture, and helps your body regulate temperature without chemical interference. No synthetic blends, dyes, or chemical treatments.</p>",
