          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warranty & Returns",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Unopened sheet sets may be returned within 30 days of delivery. For hygiene reasons, opened, used, stained, or damaged bedding cannot be returned. If your sheets arrive with a manufacturing defect, we'll make it right through a replacement or refund.</p><p>Need help? Contact our customer support team to start a return or warranty claim. <a href=\"/pages/shipping-returns-policy\" title=\"Shipping & Returns Policy\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Start Here</span></a></p>",
